
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
S2 · Tools: server.registerTool(name, config, handler)
SDK: registerTool, client.listTools, client.callTool
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

── Part 1 — registerTool config variants ─────────────────────────────────────

▶ tools/list shows how each config is advertised
  listTools()
  ✔ 4ms → 
    [
      {
        "name": "add",
        "inputSchema": {
          "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "a": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "a",
            "b"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "server_time",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {}
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "letter_of",
        "inputSchema": {
          "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "total": {
              "type": "number",
              "minimum": 0,
              "maximum": 10
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "total"
          ]
        },
        "outputSchema": {
          "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "total": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "letter": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "A",
                "B",
                "C",
                "D",
                "F"
              ]
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "total",
            "letter"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "reset_demo_data",
        "title": "Reset demo data",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {}
        },
        "annotations": {
          "readOnlyHint": false,
          "destructiveHint": true,
          "idempotentHint": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "broken_output",
        "inputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {}
        },
        "outputSchema": {
          "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "gpa": {
              "type": "number",
              "maximum": 4
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "gpa"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      }
    ]

▶ A. inputSchema only
  callTool({"name":"add","arguments":{"a":2,"b":3}})
  ✔ 7ms → 
    {
      "_meta": {
        "io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {
          "name": "tool-variants",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5"
        }
      ]
    }

▶ B. no inputSchema (no arguments)
  callTool({"name":"server_time"})
  ✔ 2ms → 
    {
      "_meta": {
        "io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {
          "name": "tool-variants",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2026-09-21T07:07:08.410Z"
        }
      ]
    }

▶ C. outputSchema → structuredContent
  callTool({"name":"letter_of","arguments":{"total":7.4}})
  ✔ 1ms → 
    {
      "_meta": {
        "io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {
          "name": "tool-variants",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "B"
        }
      ],
      "structuredContent": {
        "total": 7.4,
        "letter": "B"
      }
    }

▶ D. annotations are hints only — execution is unchanged
  callTool({"name":"reset_demo_data"})
  ✔ 1ms → 
    {
      "_meta": {
        "io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {
          "name": "tool-variants",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Nothing was actually deleted."
        }
      ]
    }

▶ E. structuredContent violating outputSchema is caught by the SDK
  callTool({"name":"broken_output"})
  ✔ 1ms → 
    {
      "_meta": {
        "io.modelcontextprotocol/serverInfo": {
          "name": "tool-variants",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Output validation error: Invalid structured content for tool broken_output: gpa: Too big: expected number to be <=4"
        }
      ],
      "isError": true
    }

